[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

; Buttons (user, 7 Nov 2026): rounded with a border, white with black text and border in the
; day. scenes/ui/night_theme.tres has the night buttons; scripts/ui/main.gd switches them.
; Bars (user, 7 Nov 2026): every bar has the health bar's rounded shape and border, a dark empty
; part and a fill: grey (the measures), white (XPBar), green (HealthBar), red (HealthBarDanger).

